            "review_title": "Review at Isushi",
            "review_text": "Minh T\nHuddersfield, United Kingdom81 contributions\n0\nKinda disappointed\nJun 2019 • Couples\nI felt really embarrassed after inviting my girlfriend to this restaurant last month. Before I had dinner here with my colleagues and the service and the food was very good so I decided to take my girlfriend there as well. But it seemed that the waiters really didn’t care about two of us. I understand that there were more table with 5-6 people there but we paid the same amount of money as they did. The food came up very different from what I chose and many dishes were missing and they kept bringing me fried chicken (!). I will never come back to this restaurant again.\nRead more\nWritten July 11, 2019",
