            "review_text": "minh Nt\nHanoi, Vietnam156 contributions\n0\nnice Japanese buffet\nNov 2018 • Friends\nI tried this last night a office friends. We tried the buffet. it cost VND400/pax. the sashimis included only salmon, tuna, octopus and kanzunoco nishin. not so nicely fresh that i would expect but okie\n\nsushi are not very nice, small, and thin slides of fishes. \nthe steaks and bbq salmon heads were nice.\n\nanyway choices of foods were a bundant, tempura, noodles, grills and hot pots. desert included sweets, yorgurt, ice creams.\nThe staffs, especially the manager were very friendly to guests\n\nThis is part of a chain in big towns in VN and are very friendly to youngsters.\nRead more\nWritten November 18, 2018",
