            "review_title": "Review at Isushi",
            "review_text": "PhamKhue\nHanoi, Vietnam139 contributions\n0\nGood place for Japanese buffet in town\nJun 2017 • Friends\nWhenever I need a buffet for business meeting, I always choose Isushi because of their sustainable quality of food and luxury private room. All types of sashimi here are quite good and fresh enough to fix your craving, especially mekajiki sashimi- super fresh from the sea! Highly recommend! Besides sashimi, this restaurant also famous for various types of grilled fish and fried food such as fried chicken, sausage, etc.. which can go directly to your heart. However, the better the fish is, the worse the meat is. The beefsteak here is to dry and tough. On the other hand, in general, the quality of all foods are the same and they also have changed a menu based on season. Good job!\nRead more\nWritten April 3, 2018",
